  "This entire album is just one song.",
  "Fela Kuti released Confusion in 1975 with his band, Africa 70.",
  "He composed and produced this Afrobeat record to highlight his African heritage.",
  "The lyrics describe the messy traffic and infrastructure problems of post-colonial Lagos.",
  "The first half is pure instrumental interplay between electric piano and drums.",
  "Critics love this highlight of his catalog for its classic Afrobeat style."
